WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.378
How many days pass from the 2th to the 5th of the same month (not counting the first

00:00:05.378 --> 00:00:09.693
day)? Let us think carefully. Count forward 3 days. The answer is 3. Great work!

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:15.805
How many days pass from the 3th to the 7th of the same month (not counting the first

00:00:15.805 --> 00:00:20.197
day)? Let us think carefully. Count forward 4 days. The answer is 4. Great work!

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:26.293
How many days pass from the 4th to the 9th of the same month (not counting the first

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:30.676
day)? Let us think carefully. Count forward 5 days. The answer is 5. Great work!

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:36.805
How many days pass from the 5th to the 11th of the same month (not counting the first

00:00:36.805 --> 00:00:41.197
day)? Let us think carefully. Count forward 6 days. The answer is 6. Great work!
